<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgolux trade surplus narrows in May.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgolux trade surplus narrows in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Office released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union with other European Union countries (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   May	 April     May 1996</p>
<p>    Exports			    459.5     513.1     445.7</p>
<p>    Imports			    440.6     477.6     412.7</p>
<p>    Balance			     19.0	35.6	33.0</p>
<p>					Jan-May 97	    Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	 2,416.6		 2,187.2</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	 2,273.5		 2,074.4</p>
<p>    Balance			    143.0		   112.8</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
